        },
        {
          "text": "Te malaika Yehovani ’yo Eliya ’ba Tisibini ma tia kini, Mi nga, mi mu uru dri fuzu ojio opi Samariaarini ’diyi be, mi ’yo yi tia kini, Emi mu Baali-zebubu adrou Ekironiari zizu, Munguni ovule aluni Israeli ma eselia kurisi ya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
